7-field :MIS one_d_viscous_matrix_fugacity, raw, read from the .jl\"\>", \
"\<\"PASS\"\>"},
    {"\<\"V-G4m-ctl\"\>", "\<\"control: at dpp = 0 it is NOT the :MIS medium \
block\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>"},
