dpp * (the exported dpp part), equation by equation\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>"},
    {"\<\"V-G5-e\"\>", "\<\"energy row on Bjorken == d_tau e + \
(e+p+Pi+pi^eta_eta)/tau\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>"},
    {"\<\"V-G5-pi\"\>", "\<\"pi^eta_eta row on Bjorken == tauS pi' + pi + 4 \
eta/(3 tau) + dpp pi/tau  (theta = 1/tau)\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>"},
    {"\<\"V-G5-Pi\"\>", "\<\"bulk row on Bjorken == tauB Pi' + Pi + \
zeta/tau\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>"},
